<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally weak on light to moderate demand and mostly moderate offerings.  Choice rib, chuck, round and loin cuts weak, while the Select cuts steady to weak.  Beef trimmings mostly steady on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>180 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 14 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>26 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     101.65	100.91	 95.80	 94.76</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.46	 -0.28	  0.16	 -0.11</p>
<p>Rib	  159.45	158.41	150.96	150.07</p>
<p>Chuck	 67.89	 65.47	 68.43	 64.84</p>
<p>Round	 85.92	 85.92	 83.13	 83.13</p>
<p>Loin	 168.13	168.56	147.41	147.97</p>
<p>Brisket     56.57	 56.57	 55.83	 55.83</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  59.85	 59.79	 60.05	 59.91</p>
<p>Flank	 56.14	 56.14	 54.92	 54.92</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
